        "",
        "burn_amount: Number of winner tokens to burn (can be 0 for harvest-only).",
        "",
        "The accumulator pattern allows:",
        "- Claims before all entries migrated (avoids market bricking)",
        "- Harvesting additional pot as losing entries migrate (with burn_amount=0)",
        "- Burning winner tokens for proportional share of the pot"
